Package: magpie
Architecture: any
Section: libs
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: C++ memory cache library.
 A library to manage advanced memory caches.
 .
 The library supports an LRU (Least Recently Used) and LFU (Least Frequently
 Used) cache with a TTL, capacity limits and more.

Package: magpie-dev
Architecture: any
Section: libdevel
Depends: magpie (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: magpie-doc
Description: C++ memory cache library development package.
 A developer library to use the magpie library.
 .
 The library supports an LRU (Least Recently Used) and LFU (Least Frequently
 Used) cache with a TTL, capacity limits and more.

Package: magpie-doc
Architecture: all
Section: doc
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: C++ memory cache library documentation.
 Documentation about the magpie library.

